EXAMPLE FILE — NOT LIVE. Rename to `apple-app-site-association` (no extension)
and deploy to https://proaudiotrainingacademy.com/.well-known/ when the website
is ready. Everything below is filled in with the project's REAL values except
where marked. Delete this header before deploying; the deployed file must be
valid JSON with nothing before the opening brace.

VERIFIED VALUES (2026-09-05)
  Apple Team ID     XAQQN594RH   (from `eas build` credentials output; the team
                                  is "Channing Booth (Individual)")
  Bundle identifier com.cbcreativeservices.apestudio   (app.json ios.bundleIdentifier)
  => appID          XAQQN594RH.com.cbcreativeservices.apestudio

DEPLOYMENT REQUIREMENTS (all are hard requirements; each one silently breaks
universal links if wrong)
  - Served over HTTPS with a valid certificate.
  - Content-Type: application/json
  - NO redirect. Apple does not follow one. On Vercel make sure no trailing-slash
    or canonical-host rule rewrites /.well-known/*.
  - No authentication. NOTE: the site is currently behind the gate flag
    (web/lib/gate.ts GATE_ENABLED). The gate must not cover /.well-known/*.
  - Under 128 KB.
  - The file has no extension.

THE APP SIDE IS NOT YET ENABLED FOR iOS. `ios.associatedDomains` was removed
from app.json on 2026-09-05 because the stored Ad Hoc provisioning profile has
no Associated Domains capability and a --non-interactive EAS build cannot add
it. After this file is live: add

    "associatedDomains": ["applinks:proaudiotrainingacademy.com",
                          "applinks:www.proaudiotrainingacademy.com"]

under expo.ios, then run `eas build --profile development --platform ios` ONCE
interactively so EAS can sign in to Apple and regenerate the profile.

PATHS mirror docs/discoverability/URL_ROUTE_CONTRACT.md. The NOT entries are
listed FIRST because Apple evaluates in order and first match wins — credential
and account pages must stay in the browser.

{
  "applinks": {
    "apps": [],
    "details": [
      {
        "appID": "XAQQN594RH.com.cbcreativeservices.apestudio",
        "paths": [
          "NOT /verify/*",
          "NOT /registry/*",
          "NOT /u/*",
          "NOT /login",
          "NOT /reset-password",
          "NOT /dashboard/*",
          "NOT /api/*",
          "/get",
          "/glossary",
          "/glossary/*",
          "/topics/*",
          "/tools",
          "/tools/*",
          "/learn",
          "/labs",
          "/labs/*",
          "/awards/*",
          "/directory",
          "/careers"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

NOT INCLUDED ON PURPOSE
  /subjects/*   the app cannot focus a subject yet, so the website keeps these
                links. See URL_ROUTE_CONTRACT.md §3.

AFTER DEPLOYING, verify:
  curl -sI https://proaudiotrainingacademy.com/.well-known/apple-app-site-association
      expect 200, content-type application/json, no Location header
  curl -s  https://proaudiotrainingacademy.com/.well-known/apple-app-site-association | jq .
      expect valid JSON
  Then on a device with a build made AFTER associatedDomains is restored, tap a
  link from Notes or Messages (Safari's address bar does not trigger universal
  links). Apple's CDN caches this file, so allow time or reinstall the app.
